4
00:01:24,318 --> 00:01:26,554
* HOME OF THE BEAVER

5
00:01:26,587 --> 00:01:29,323
* WHERE STILL
THE MIGHTY MOOSE *

6
00:01:29,357 --> 00:01:32,193
* WANDERS AT WILL

7
00:01:32,226 --> 00:01:34,628
* BLUE LAKE AND ROCKY SHORE

8
00:01:34,662 --> 00:01:37,331
* I WILL RETURN ONCE MORE

9
